Acceptance criteria

The feature is complete when:

1. 0001_cloneav1–10.png exist only under assets/characters/0001/.
2. The incorrect old 0001_ cloneav8.png path does not exist.
3. Clone cloud appearance plays exactly 1→10.
4. Clone cloud disappearance plays exactly 10→1.
5. Clone effect frames preload with #0001.
6. Clone clouds are normalized as effects, not fighter-height animations.
7. Clone Attack requires #0001 to already be Charging.
8. Charge must still be held when BA1 is pressed.
9. Fresh simultaneous Charge+BA1 from Idle does not summon.
10. Successful Charged BA1 costs exactly 25 Energy.
11. Energy never goes below 0.
12. 25 Energy is enough for exactly one summon.
13. Less than 25 Energy produces no clone and falls back to normal BA1.
14. Missing required clone artwork spends no Energy.
15. Normal BA1 remains unchanged outside the Charged combo.
16. The real #0001 does not perform BA1 during a successful clone summon.
17. The real #0001 remains Charging while Charge remains held.
18. The clone appears on the opponent’s back side.
19. Its position/facing are snapshotted and do not track afterward.
20. The clone uses #0001’s actual existing BA1 sprite frames.
21. The clone uses the existing BA1 combat definition.
22. Clone BA1 can hit only once.
23. Clone damage/knockback comes from the clone’s position/facing.
24. The clone is not targetable and has no Health/pushbox.
25. Clone attacks respect Dodge invulnerability.
26. Future Block defense uses correct rear/front attack direction.
27. A clone hit does not apply hitstop to the real owner.
28. The clone finishes even if the owner releases Charge or gets hit afterward.
29. The clone always vanishes after its attack, hit or miss.
30. Multiple paid summons can coexist independently while Energy allows.
31. Restart/rematch removes all clones and refills Energy.
32. The Energy HUD immediately reflects the cost.
33. No other current action consumes or regenerates Energy.
34. Training CPU remains non-attacking.
35. README, Help, comments, and ALVA_SPEC.md describe the new move and Energy behavior accurately.
